    - Term: item.clothing_top_alloy.desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Metal plates over the shoulders. Someone made this to be seen in.
      - "\u041C\u0435\u0442\u0430\u043B\u043B\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043A\u0438\u0435
