    - Term: item.clothing_shirt_amy_07.desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Loose, long-sleeved, worn open. Covers the arms and little else.
      - "\u0421\u0432\u043E\u0431\u043E\u0434\u043D\u0430\u044F, \u0441 \u0434\u043B\u0438\u043D\u043D\u044B\u043C
