    - Term: item.clothing_skirt_amy_04.desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Short and pleated, sitting on the hip. Warms nothing at all.
      - "\u041A\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0442\u043A\u0430\u044F, \u0432 \u0441\u043A\u043B\u0430\u0434\u043A\u0443,
