      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: item.clothing_blouse_waist_riot_denim.name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Blouse Tied at the Waist (Denim)
      - "\u0411\u043B\u0443\u0437\u043A\u0430 \u043D\u0430 \u043F\u043E\u044F\u0441\u0435
        (Denim)"
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: item.clothing_blouse_waist_riot_denim.desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Sleeves knotted at the hip. Not worn so much as carried.
      - "\u0420\u0443\u043A\u0430\u0432\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u0432\u044F\u0437\u0430\u043D\u044B
        \u043D\u0430 \u0431\u0435\u0434\u0440\u0435. \u0421\u043A\u043E\u0440\u0435\u0435
        \u043D\u043E\u0441\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044F \u0441 \u0441\u043E\u0431\u043E\u0439,
        \u0447\u0435\u043C \u043D\u0430\u0434\u0435\u0442\u0430."
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: item.clothing_blouse_waist_riot_green.name
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Blouse Tied at the Waist (Green)
      - "\u0411\u043B\u0443\u0437\u043A\u0430 \u043D\u0430 \u043F\u043E\u044F\u0441\u0435
        (Green)"
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: item.clothing_blouse_waist_riot_green.desc
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Sleeves knotted at the hip. Not worn so much as carried.
      - "\u0420\u0443\u043A\u0430\u0432\u0430 \u0437\u0430\u0432\u044F\u0437\u0430\u043D\u044B
