      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: journal.HutCompleted.did.v0
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The hut is finished. We have walls.
      - "\u0425\u0438\u0436\u0438\u043D\u0430 \u0433\u043E\u0442\u043E\u0432\u0430.
        \u0423 \u043D\u0430\u0441 \u0435\u0441\u0442\u044C \u0441\u0442\u0435\u043D\u044B."
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: journal.FurnitureBuilt.did.v0
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Finished the build. It stands.
      - "\u0414\u043E\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043E\u0438\u043B\u0430. \u0421\u0442\u043E\u0438\u0442."
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: journal.RackCrafted.did.v0
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The drying rack is up.
      - "\u0421\u0443\u0448\u0438\u043B\u043A\u0430 \u0433\u043E\u0442\u043E\u0432\u0430."
      Flags: 0101
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: journal.RaftLaunched.did.v0
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - The raft is in the water. It's really in the water.
      - "\u041F\u043B\u043E\u0442 \u043D\u0430 \u0432\u043E\u0434\u0435. \u041E\u043D
